  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞天鹅绒房间……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 0B 01 10 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}一直以来，\n谢谢大家的照顾。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 10 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}那个……能让我看看地图吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}地图？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 09 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}可以是可以……{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}最后……我想再看看。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞应玲的请求，\n　拿出了至今绘制的地图……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 11 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}谢谢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}玲……\n为什么哭了？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……善向我说起过一些\n玲生前的事情。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}小时候喜欢绘本，\n梦想着和王子幸福地结婚……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}明明向往着学校，却被病魔缠身，\n不得不在医院度过……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}随后离世，\n在此地举行了镇魂仪式……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0073",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}这些不正是\n我们走过的那些迷宫吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0073",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}也就是说，玲……\n我们重走了一遍你的人生。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0073",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}如此想来，绘制的地图，\n或许就是\n玲的人生轨迹……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 0F 01 02 01}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}……不仅是玲。\n也是在迷宫中前进的你们，\n在此时此刻留下的生命轨迹。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}或许每个人，\n都在不停地绘制自己的地图。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0F 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}感觉净是迷路了啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}无论什么路，你们都能走下去。\n因为你们并不孤单。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 21 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}嗯……是啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}也请让我向你们道谢。\n还有，真的很对不起。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}明明一切都是我引起的，\n却得到了你们所有人的帮助。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:14:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 0F 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}接下来，我要带着玲启程……\n前往“永恒”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}永恒……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}一切生命诞生、回归的地方……\n恐怕我也会在那里，\n和玲一起回归。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0142",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}因为我已不再是人们渴望、\n由人们创造的“柯罗诺斯”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0D 01 0F 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}善……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 11 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}玲。\n就像你活过一样，我也活过。\n在这个世界，和你一起。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:19:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}是你赋予了我生命。\n我……有竭尽全力地活过吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 0F 01 0F 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}走吧……“菲蕾”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 11 01 0F 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 01}菲蕾……\n那时候，善替我取的……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 13 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 01}你的名字。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:23:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 01}……意思是“心爱之人”。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 13 01 0F 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}善……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 22 01}哟～哟～……吸鼻子。\n真是恩爱呀。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 01}真是的，小熊！正感动呢！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 24 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}可系……\n一想到再也见不到你们啦……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 29 01 09 01 0F 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 01}呵呵……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:28:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 01}我……我真的很开心。\n真的，谢谢你们。\n谢谢……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 27 01}真的……要分别了啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 01}玲、善……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_020.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0272",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 29 01}再见……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]